      "writtenOn": "2020-07-24T16:10:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There aren\u0027t any asserts or checks to enforce that all ports are virtual when CONFIG_USB_MUX_VIRTUAL is defined.\n\nNested muxes can still mean that a downstream mux is brought out of low power mode by the USB_MUX_GET_MODE request.  This code won\u0027t put the nested mux back into low-power mode.\n\nI\u0027m still in favor of removing this check (which matches the behavior of the previous code).  The rest of the CL looks good.",
